  "body": "If you’ve been waiting for an affordable entry into St Heliers, this is it!  Rarely do apartments this close to the beach and village become available at such an accessible price point. Barely 100m from the waterfront and tucked quietly around the corner from the village, this smart easy-care one bedroom apartment offers the Bays lifestyle - perfect as a first-buy or a secure lockup-and-leave option.\r\nPositioned on the ground floor, this light filled apartment offers comfortable open-plan living, a petite but modern kitchen, bathroom and a generous bedroom - all designed for low-maintenance living and maximum ease. An allocated off-street car park adds valuable convenience.\r\nStep outside and everything is at your fingertips. Morning swims, waterfront walks along Tamaki Drive, coffee with friends, boutique shopping, wine bars and local dining are all just moments away. With easy transport links to the CBD, you can enjoy a relaxed beachside lifestyle without giving up city convenience.\r\nThis is a perfectly positioned home base to simply enjoy living in the Bay or as a lock up and leave - this is affordable St Heliers living.  Enquire today.\r\nContact Murray for more information.",
